---
import SiteNavigation from './SiteNavigation.astro';
import entries from '../data/curation-editions.json';
const {view = 'daily'} = Astro.props;
const title = view === 'topics' ? '按主题看信息' : '日报';
const canonical = new URL(view === 'topics' ? '/curation/topics/' : '/curation/', Astro.site);
const dates = [...new Set(entries.map(e=>e.issue))].sort().reverse();
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="思远 AI Labs 认知策展：按日报和主题阅读有来源的中文信息摘编。"><link rel="canonical" href={canonical}><title>{title} · 思远 AI Labs</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/curation/style.css?v=20260925"><script id="curation-data" type="application/json" set:html={JSON.stringify(entries).replace(/</g, "\\u003c")} /><script is:inline src="/curation/app.js?v=20260925" defer></script></head>
<body class:list={{"topic-view": view === "topics"}}><a class="skip" href="#main">跳到正文</a>
<SiteNavigation active={view} />
<aside class="date-nav" id="date-nav" hidden={view === "topics"} aria-label="日期导航"><div class="rail-heading"><h2>阅读日历</h2><button id="close-dates" class="mobile-only" aria-label="关闭日期导航">关闭</button></div><div class="month"><button id="prev-month" aria-label="上个月">‹</button><strong id="month-title"></strong><button id="next-month" aria-label="下个月">›</button></div><div class="weekdays" aria-hidden="true"><span>一</span><span>二</span><span>三</span><span>四</span><span>五</span><span>六</span><span>日</span></div><div id="calendar" class="calendar"></div><p class="calendar-note">带下划线的日期有收录内容</p><button class="all-dates" id="all-dates">查看全部日期</button><div class="history-heading">历史日期</div><label class="sr-only" for="history-search">检索历史日期</label><input id="history-search" type="search" placeholder="查找日期，如 09-24"><div id="history"></div><p class="rail-note">日期为日报刊期<br>原文时间见内容详情</p></aside>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="topbar"><div id="breadcrumb">认知策展 / {title}</div><button id="open-dates" hidden={view === "topics"} class="date-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="date-nav">日历与历史</button><a class="prototype" href="/">返回首页</a></div><div class="reading-wrap"><div id="list-view"><header class="page-heading"><img class="reading-illustration" src="/curation/reading-illustration.png" width="2120" height="742" alt="" fetchpriority="high"><h1 id="page-title">{title}</h1><p id="page-intro">{view === "daily" ? "按日期读，慢慢积累。" : "从一个主题开始，找到值得重读的内容。"}</p></header><div class="demo-notice">保留来源，分清事实与判断。中文内容为来源材料的摘编。</div><section id="topic-tools" hidden={view !== "topics"} aria-label="内容筛选"><label class="sr-only" for="search">搜索内容或来源</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="搜索内容、概念或来源"><div class="filter-row"><div id="domains" role="group" aria-label="领域"></div><label class="sr-only" for="kind">内容类型</label><select id="kind"><option value="全部">全部类型</option><option>动态</option><option>方法</option><option>观点</option></select></div></section><div id="results-status" class="results-status" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="issues">{dates.map(date => <section class="issue" aria-label={`${date} 刊期`}><div class="issue-heading"><h2>{date.slice(5).replace('-', '月')}日</h2><span>{date.slice(0,4)}</span><small>{entries.filter(e=>e.issue===date).length} 条</small></div><div class="issue-items">{entries.filter(e=>e.issue===date).map(e=><article class="story"><div class="story-meta"><span>{e.domain}</span><span>{e.kind}摘编</span></div><h3><a href={`#entry/${e.id}?from=${view}`}>{e.title}</a></h3><p class="summary">{e.summary}</p><div class="story-bottom"><span class="source-name">{e.source}</span><a class="read-link" href={`#entry/${e.id}?from=${view}`}>阅读摘编 →</a><a class="source-link" href={e.urls[0]} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">原文 ↗</a></div></article>)}</div></section>)}</div><noscript><p>完整摘编与日期、主题筛选需要启用 JavaScript；也可直接阅读各条原文。</p></noscript></div><article id="detail-view" hidden></article><footer><p>© 2026 思远 AI Labs</p><div class="legal"><a href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">浙ICP备2026063003号</a><a href="http://www.beian.gov.cn/portal/registerSystemInfo?recordcode=33021102001302" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">浙公网安备33021102001302号</a><a href="https://github.com/SiyuanAiLab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></div></footer></div></main>
<div class="scrim" id="scrim" hidden></div></body></html>
